# Backup files (editor autosave, refactor .bak artifacts)
*.bak
*.bak.ts
# Patch/merge residue: `patch` writes .orig on a fuzzy-context mismatch, which
# lands the rejected pre-image INSIDE src/ and pollutes git status. Observed live:
# src/index.ts.runbench.orig survived every existing .bak guard.
*.orig
*.rej

# Agent probe residue. Both repos park mutation backups, commit-message drafts
# and coverage probes here; this one accumulated 301 untracked entries and
# `git add -A` staged 359 paths, because the guard was written for woclaw only.
# `files` in package.json already excludes _tmp/, so npm publish is unaffected —
# the exposure was to `git add -A` and to `git status` noise. Sibling fix and
# guard: woclaw hub/test/gitignore_residue_guard.test.ts (2026-10-07).
_tmp/
**/_tmp/
